  "description": "Affordable US style, crowned the \"best electric beach cruiser\".\nCruise the beach boardwalk or bike path in style with the Denago Cruiser 1 Step-thru.It features a classic look and comfortable, upright riding position with a padded saddle and high-rise handlebar. A fun electric bike that anyone can jump on and ride, guaranteed to make you smile! Cruiser 1 offers both pedal assist and throttle modes, so you can choose how to ride. The step-thru frame style is ideal for riders with shorter inseams or those who have difficulty throwing a leg over the saddle.\nPatrick Brady of Electric Bike Report calls the Cruiser 1 \"an ultra-affordable, modern (and electrified) take on an American icon\" and named it to their list of 2023's \"best electric beach cruisers.\"",
